  "question": {
    "text": "The mean of the coefficients of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in the binomial expression of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>9</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is _________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2736",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know that.</p><p>Binomial expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, sum of coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>8</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>19683</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>512</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>19152</mn></math></p><p>Now mean is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>19152</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2736</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
